# PATCH(ds41-lazy-engram) 2026-11-10: boot host-RAM peak fix for lazy Engram RAM tables (image .11/.12 vLLM).
# Apply in site-packages: cd /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages && patch -p1 < vllm-ds41-lazy-engram-boot-ram.patch
# (.12 builds: apply after the vision-staging model.py; the hunks apply to both model.py versions.)
# Inactive unless DS41_ENGRAM_LAZY_SELF_ARM=1 and/or DS41_ENGRAM_LAZY_PARALLEL=1; only matters with
# DS41_ENGRAM_LAZY_RAM_LAYERS set.
#  - DS41_ENGRAM_LAZY_SELF_ARM=1: every TP rank creates the promotion arm file on its first real (non-dummy) batch,
#    so lazy tables are filled before any request reads them and all ranks take the fill/barrier branch on the same step.
#  - DS41_ENGRAM_LAZY_PARALLEL=1: fill all ranks' lazy tables at once when every rank has room for all of them + margin.
--- a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/nvidia/model.py
